sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Lambda
    participant Stripe
    participant DB as DynamoDB
    participant Email as SES

    User->>Frontend: Access account settings
    Frontend->>API: GET /v1/user/profile (JWT)
    API->>Lambda: Forward request
    Lambda->>DB: Fetch subscription data
    DB-->>Lambda: Subscription details
    Lambda-->>Frontend: Display subscription info

    alt Manage Subscription
        User->>Frontend: Click "Manage Billing"
        Frontend->>API: POST /v1/shop/billing-portal (JWT)
        API->>Lambda: Forward request
        Lambda->>Stripe: Create portal session
        Stripe-->>Lambda: Portal URL
        Lambda-->>Frontend: Redirect URL
        Frontend->>User: Redirect to Stripe portal
        User->>Stripe: Make changes (cancel, upgrade)
        Stripe->>Lambda: subscription.updated webhook
        Lambda->>DB: Update subscription status
        Lambda->>Email: Send status update email
        Email-->>User: Confirmation email
    end
